stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Native: no open run, layout matches the plan
    Native --> Changed: outside write or new entry
    Changed --> Native: new plan, rehearsed
    Native --> Interrupted: switch begun, then a crash
    Native --> Active: switch begun, each part switched
    Interrupted --> Native: resumed inverse ends
    Interrupted --> Drifted: outside write breaks the prefix
    Active --> Complete: probes pass, receipt
    Active --> Interrupted: failed probe, crash in the inverse
    Active --> Native: failed probe, inverse ends
    Complete --> Drifted: outside write to a cell
    Complete --> Changed: step 14 finds an outside entry, inverse ends
    Drifted --> Complete: the cell is switched again
    Drifted --> Native: owner's inverse ends
    Drifted --> Changed: owner's inverse leaves a third value
    Complete --> Native: owner's inverse ends
